+; NOTE: Assertions have been autogenerated by utils/update_test_checks.py UTC_ARGS: --version 6
+; RUN: opt -passes=dse -S %s | FileCheck %s
+
+; The pointer read in the inner loop is based on either %data or a pointer
+; loaded in the outer loop, through nested loop phis. The first store to
+; %buf.gep is dead if that read cannot alias %buf, which depends on whether %buf
+; may have been captured before the load of %p.
